What this covers
----------------
This project's own work in data/: headlines, summaries, classifications
(category, action type, vendor kind), extracted fields (vendor names,
schools, dollar amounts, terms), flags, second readings, corrections,
vendor profiles, and the derived files in data/published/ and data/exports/
built from them.

It does not cover the official records of the Oakland Unified School
District reproduced here from Legistar (titles, action text, file numbers,
histories, votes and attachments), which are public records. The code in
this repository is licensed separately under the MIT License (LICENSE).

